(R2*cos\(29.04\) - \(0.5003*R2\)*sin\(14.04\) = 25 kN.) Tj
T*
(R2 * [ 0.8743 - 0.5003*0.2426 ] = 25 => R2 * [ 0.7529 ] = 25 => R2 = 33.20 kN.) Tj
T*
(Solution Step 3: Equilibrium of the horizontal wedge:) Tj
T*
(Forces on wedge: Horizontal force P; interface reaction R2 from block; floor reaction R3) Tj
T*
(inclined at phi = 14.04 deg to vertical normal.) Tj
T*
(Sigma Fx = 0 => P - R3*sin\(phi\) - R2*sin\(alpha + phi\) = 0 => P = R3*sin\(14.04\) +) Tj
T*
(33.20*sin\(29.04\).) Tj
T*
(Sigma Fy = 0 => R3*cos\(phi\) - R2*cos\(alpha + phi\) = 0 => R3 = 33.20 * cos\(29.04\) /) Tj
T*
(cos\(14.04\) = 33.20 * \(0.8743 / 0.9701\) = 29.92 kN.) Tj
T*
(Now compute P: P = 29.92 * sin\(14.04\) + 33.20 * sin\(29.04\) = 29.92 * 0.2426 + 33.20 *) Tj
T*
(0.4854 = 7.26 + 16.11 = 23.37 kN.) Tj
